  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;Insufficient information has been provided to demonstrate that the proposed development would not have any adverse impact on the protected species contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies G6 of the London Plan (2021), and GI3 and Strategic Policy 07 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;Insufficient information has been submitted to demonstrate that the proposed development would have no adverse surface water flood risk for the future occupiers on the application site, contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), policies SI 12 and SI 13 of the London Plan (2021) and policies CN3 and CN4 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposal, by reason of the inadequate floor to ceiling heights at the ground and first floors of the proposed, would result in a sub-standard level of living accommodation for the future occupiers contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D6 of the London Plan (2021), Policies GR1 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041), Housing Design Standards London Plan Guidance (2023) and Residential Design Guide Supplementary Planning Document (2010).&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
